<title>PERU: Peru's Minsur Q1 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Peru's Minsur Q1 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share - N.A.</p>
<p>Net - 30.7 million soles vs 23.1 million soles</p>
<p>Revs - 107.2 million soles vs 78.8 million soles</p>
<p>NOTE: Minsur SA, Peru's only tin miner, is the world's third largest tin producer. The company operates the San Rafael mine in Peru's southern highlands.</p>
<p>((-- Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134)</p>
</text>
